# Files Fern must NOT overwrite when it regenerates this SDK (via PR from the
# hedra-labs/fern-config repo). See https://buildwithfern.com/learn/sdks/capabilities/customize-files

# Lockfile is hand-resolved (Fern's lock targets its own pyproject)
poetry.lock

# Local-dev ignores are hand-maintained
.gitignore

# README is hand-curated: the quickstart (submit -> poll -> result), auth notes,
# custom base URL, streaming and upload sections. Fern's README generator only
# keeps sections whose headings it does not own; it rewrites Usage, Advanced,
# Installation, ... wholesale on every regeneration, and fern-replay would then
# try to re-apply the hand edits as patches on top (ENG-10135's failure mode).
# When the generator's boilerplate moves, regenerate locally in fern-config
# (`fern generate --group python-local --local`) and diff .local-python/README.md
# against this file. tests/custom/test_readme.py fails if the README references
# a method or import the shipped client no longer has.
README.md

# version.py looks up the hedra-sdk distribution
src/hedra/version.py
# Hand-written client wrapper: reads HEDRA_API_KEY at construction time.
# BaseHedra/AsyncBaseHedra (base_client.py) regenerate normally.
src/hedra/client.py

# NOTE: src/hedra/core/http_client.py is deliberately NOT listed here.
# It used to be, to hold a one-line fix for `retry-after-ms` parsing (upstream Fern
# compares the header string to an int; the TypeError is swallowed by a bare `except`,
# so upstream just ignores the header and falls through to `retry-after`). Freezing the
# file to keep that fix meant hand-porting it on every generator bump, and it had already
# drifted far enough to fail the generated tests. The Hedra API does not send
# `retry-after-ms`, so the fix was not worth the recurring cost. Do not re-add this entry
# to restore it — fix it upstream in fern-python-sdk instead.


# Hand-maintained docs / history
CHANGELOG.md
MIGRATION.md
LICENSE

# CI is hand-maintained (Fern doesn't manage workflows here)
.github/

# Hand-written tests
tests/custom/
.fern/replay.lock
.fern/replay.yml
.gitattributes
